{"Header panel misaligned: .panel was converted from float-based alignment to flex alignment (margin-left: auto and order(3)), but .panel is not a direct child of the flex container (.contents), so the flex alignment won't work and the login panel won't align to the right edge": 0.43216004967689514, "Non-standard -ms-align-items property in @mixin align-items is not a valid CSS property and will be silently ignored by all browsers - the correct IE10 vendor-prefixed equivalent is -ms-flex-align which is already present": 0.2807476818561554, "Floats and clear inside flex container: .small-action now uses flexbox but its children .topic-avatar and button still have float: left and float: right respectively, and the container has clear: both - these float properties are ignored on flex items per CSS spec, indicating incomplete migration": 0.2195686399936676, "-webkit-box-ordinal-group off-by-one: The @mixin order($val) passes $val directly to -webkit-box-ordinal-group, but the old -webkit-box spec uses 1-based ordinal groups while CSS3 order is 0-based, so the correct mapping should be $val + 1": 0.8944382667541504}